sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Auditor as Auditor de Glosas (Dashboard)
    actor Agente as Agente IA / MCP Client
    participant Nginx as Nginx (Gateway)
    participant Core as public/index.php (Core Boot)
    participant REST as Controllers (API)
    participant Redis as Redis (APCu/Streams)
    participant Drive as Google Drive API
    
    Note over Auditor, REST: Flujo 1: Acceso Dashboard & CORS/RateLimit
    Auditor->>Nginx: GET /invoices (REST Request)
    Nginx->>Core: FastCGI request
    Core->>Core: CORS Check (Allowed Origins)
    Core->>Redis: Rate Limit Check (100 req/min via APCu)
    alt Rate Limit Exceeded
        Redis-->>Core: Throttle limits hit
        Core-->>Auditor: HTTP 429 Too Many Requests (Fail-Closed)
    else Limit OK
        Core->>REST: Dispatch to controller
        REST-->>Auditor: HTTP 200 JSON Response
    end

    Note over Agente, REST: Flujo 2: Webhook MCP (X-API-KEY)
    Agente->>Nginx: POST /app/wrap/webhook.php (JSON-RPC)
    Nginx->>Core: FastCGI request
    Core->>Core: Validate X-API-KEY header vs MCP_WEBHOOK_SECRET
    alt Invalid API Key
        Core-->>Agente: HTTP 401 Unauthorized (Access Denied)
    else Authorized
        Core->>REST: MCPServer route tool execution
        REST-->>Agente: JSON-RPC 2.0 Response (Tool Output)
    end

    Note over REST, Drive: Flujo 3: Autenticación JWT Google Drive
    REST->>REST: Llama GoogleDriveAuthService::getAccessToken()
    REST->>Drive: POST https://oauth2.googleapis.com/token (JWT Claim: email, private_key PEM)
    Drive-->>REST: Bearer OAuth2 Token (Vigencia 1 hora)
    REST->>Drive: GET https://www.googleapis.com/drive/v3/files/{id}?alt=media
    Drive-->>REST: Document Stream (PDF/Image)
